WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
ReadyDorm is a SafetyTech residential platform for students, roommates, managers, and emergency contacts.

00:02.000 --> 00:05.000
Residents prepare an emergency profile, trusted contacts, evacuation routes, and a 72-hour backpack.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.000
During a crisis, SOS, voice support, flashlight mode, false alarm cancellation, and safe check-ins guide the response.

00:08.000 --> 00:10.500
The manager dashboard shows resident status, evacuation routes, meeting points, IoT sensors, and nearby support.

00:10.500 --> 00:12.000
Roommates, families, and residence staff coordinate from one shared emergency workflow.
